## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design privacy-preserving, scalable PCA in federated, non‑IID environments with streaming updates and edge constraints. It probes local imputation, secure aggregation, drift detection, and robust evaluation under limited communication.

## Key Concepts
- Federated incremental PCA and rank-k SVD
- Local imputation and standardization
- Secure aggregation for global basis
- Drift detection via explained variance and reconstruction error
- Handling non‑IID data with weighted updates

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: federated PCA update flow
function federatedPCAUpdate(siteBatch) {
  const X = imputeAndStd(siteBatch);
  const {U,S,Vt} = onlineSVD(X, currentBasis);
  publishSecureSum(Vt);
}
```

